==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 12~14 seconds<sup>360f~420f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 25.67 seconds<sup>770f</sup>, delay 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nekondo SP (Enemy)|Nekondo SP]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 43 seconds<sup>1,290f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stage is pretty straightforward, just send a wall of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to stall the enemy or spam a lot of heavy hitters like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to finish the stage quickly. Even the boss isn't much of a threat.

